    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA/status/2042854630300713031",
      "reply_text": "Yeah the East is getting locked up quickly",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T09:50:02.717142+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TrashTalk_fr/status/2042882165310955988",
      "reply_text": "That's a huge turnaround. The Spurs have been on a roll",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-11T09:50:43.567255+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SpursReporter/status/2042851690655748411",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, seeding matters. Could make a difference in the playoffs.",
